    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for JupyterLab Server, the set of REST API services that JupyterLab depends on. Provides endpoints for managing user-defined settings, workspaces, themes, translations, third-party license reports, and extension listings. JupyterLab Server runs as a Jupyter Server extension.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Jupyter Project\n Email: jupyter@googlegroups.com",
